WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:04.822
(dramatic, energetic music)

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.273
- I know a ton of you are not familiar

00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:35.179
with my Monday-to-Monday playlist
that I update every Monday

00:00:35.179 --> 00:00:37.596
with Mike Boyd on my Spotify.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.051
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.065
- Monday and Monday.

00:01:26.065 --> 00:01:27.349
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:27.349 --> 00:01:29.335
That's what's up.

00:01:29.335 --> 00:01:32.668
("So Up" by Euro Gotit)

00:01:34.096 --> 00:01:36.051
- Monday to Monday, oops, this is me.

00:01:36.051 --> 00:01:37.340
I gotta go, see ya, bye.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.923
Okay, everyone out.

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:43.182
(peaceful music)

00:01:46.134 --> 00:01:47.384
I want this whole thing,

00:01:47.384 --> 00:01:49.759
don't cut it 'cause you'll
lose too much context.

00:01:49.759 --> 00:01:53.082
For titling Instagram, and try your best,

00:01:53.082 --> 00:01:57.415
I would say the only anecdote
I know is perspective.

00:01:59.079 --> 00:02:01.329
Let's play with that, okay?

00:02:03.904 --> 00:02:06.404
Yeah, what is it, 28-26-24-20?

00:02:07.289 --> 00:02:10.203
Hello friend or family,
I'm Gary Vaynerchuk,

00:02:10.203 --> 00:02:13.553
making this video for a
small select group of people

00:02:13.553 --> 00:02:16.744
that John, Nate, and I are
going to be reaching out to

00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:19.755
here in the month of August and September

00:02:19.755 --> 00:02:23.377
to get part of our new wine project.

00:02:23.377 --> 00:02:25.456
(feedback test pattern plays)

00:02:25.456 --> 00:02:28.873
("Win the Day" by Feeki)

00:02:40.328 --> 00:02:42.288
You can't figure it out?

00:02:42.288 --> 00:02:45.305
- There's just a lot of
already committed stuff,

00:02:45.305 --> 00:02:47.885
like a 4-D's on the 13th, here.

00:02:47.885 --> 00:02:49.232
- How many are sold?

00:02:49.232 --> 00:02:50.709
- Four sold, two comped.

00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:54.820
- Good. Love you for answering so quickly.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.237
("Win the Day by Feeki")

